(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a759bb8c-4595-424b-8f57-99db1416628d))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a5a42e28-39c6-454d-932a-faf7a6ec28e3))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pinout confirmed from the board: PG, EN, VIN, GND, VOUT (1-5) plus a corner GND (6). EN and PG unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3b3a83bc-cd41-4590-8f4f-82b901472cc8))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c572f6f-f204-4f91-b4f4-4af1921b5996))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ce42221a-d1f1-416f-ba0f-1ad846cdc2b0))
